# Assets

## group-a.js

```js
// a.js
(globalThis.log ??= []).push("a");
// dyn.js
var dyn_default = () => console.log("dyn");
export { dyn_default as default };

```

## group-b.js

```js
// b.js
(globalThis.log ??= []).push("b");

